  "description": "<h1>Panasonic SA-PM02</h1>\nThe Panasonic SA-PM02 is a compact stereo system designed for playing CDs and digital music from USB devices. The system features a sleek, all-in-one design with two front-facing speakers that deliver clear and dynamic sound. The CD player supports both CD-R and CD-RW formats, and the USB port allows you to play MP3 files from your USB flash drive. The system also has an FM tuner With its easy-to-use controls and versatile playback options, the Panasonic SA-PM02 is a great choice for anyone who wants a simple and reliable stereo system for their home or office. This 3D model is to scale.\n<h2>Textures:</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>2k, and 4k Textures</li>\n  <li>2 texture sets/ materials</li>\n  <li>OpenGL + DirectX Normal Maps</li>\n  <li>Baked Ambient Occlusion</li>\n  <li>PBR workflow</li>\n  <li>JPG format</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>File Formats:</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li>.blend (Native)</li>\n  <li>.fbx</li>\n</ul>",
